{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-shard-queries","title":"跨分片查询与聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/challenges/cross-shard-queries","wordCount":1638,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨分片查询与聚合\">跨分片查询与聚合</h1><p>在单机上，<code>SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders WHERE status=&#39;paid&#39;</code> 和 <code>users JOIN orders</code> 是再寻常不过的语句，优化器替你把一切打理妥当。一旦数据分到二十个分片上，这两条语句就从「数据库的事」变成了「分布式系统的事」：得向每个分片发请求、等最慢的那个、处理某个分片超时、再把碎片化的结果拼回成一个正确答案。这一篇讲清跨分片查询为什么难、难在哪，以及工程上怎么把这份难度压到可接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨分片查询的执行模型叫散布-聚集（scatter-gather）：协调节点把查询「散布」到相关分片并行执行，再把各分片的局部结果「聚集」合并成最终结果。难点全藏在「合并」和「等待」两步里。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[客户端查询] --&gt; B[协调节点/路由层]&#10;    B --&gt; C{带分区键?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[定向单分片&lt;br/&gt;快速返回]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[散布到所有分片]&#10;    E --&gt; F[分片1 局部结果]&#10;    E --&gt; G[分片2 局部结果]&#10;    E --&gt; H[分片N 局部结果]&#10;    F --&gt; I[聚集合并]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[排序/聚合/分页]&#10;    J --&gt; K[返回客户端]\">flowchart TD\n    A[客户端查询] --&gt; B[协调节点/路由层]\n    B --&gt; C{带分区键?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[定向单分片&lt;br/&gt;快速返回]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[散布到所有分片]\n    E --&gt; F[分片1 局部结果]\n    E --&gt; G[分片2 局部结果]\n    E --&gt; H[分片N 局部结果]\n    F --&gt; I[聚集合并]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[排序/聚合/分页]\n    J --&gt; K[返回客户端]</pre><p>下表按查询类型梳理跨分片的难度与代价：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询类型</th>\n<th>单分片可完成?</th>\n<th>跨分片代价</th>\n<th>缓解手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>带分区键的点查</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>天然单分片命中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不带分区键的查询</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>散布到所有分片</td>\n<td>全局二级索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨分片 JOIN</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>数据搬移或扇出</td>\n<td>同位置存储/反规范化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局聚合 COUNT/SUM</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>各分片局部聚合再合并</td>\n<td>可分解聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局 ORDER BY + LIMIT</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>每分片多取再归并</td>\n<td>归并排序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可分解聚合与不可分解聚合\">可分解聚合与不可分解聚合</h2><p>不是所有聚合在跨分片时都一样难，关键看它能否被分解。<code>COUNT</code>、<code>SUM</code>、<code>MAX</code>、<code>MIN</code> 是可分解的：让每个分片算出自己的局部值，协调节点再把局部值合并即可。全局总数等于各分片计数之和，全局最大值等于各分片最大值的最大值——数学上一步到位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SUM</mtext><mtext>global</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>SUM</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>MAX</mtext><mtext>global</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>MAX</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SUM}_{\\text{global}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\text{SUM}_i, \\qquad \\text{MAX}_{\\text{global}} = \\max_{i=1}^{N} \\text{MAX}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SUM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">global</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SUM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAX</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">global</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9366em;vertical-align:-0.7277em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2089em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6306em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAX</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>AVG</code> 看似不可分解，实则只要每个分片返回 <code>(SUM, COUNT)</code> 两个量，协调节点用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>SUM</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>COUNT</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\sum \\text{SUM}_i}{\\sum \\text{COUNT}_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">COUNT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SUM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 即可还原，并不需要把所有原始行拉回来。</p>\n<p>真正棘手的是 <code>COUNT(DISTINCT x)</code> 和中位数、百分位这类需要全局视野的聚合。去重计数无法靠各分片的局部去重数相加（同一个值可能出现在多个分片），精确计算要么把所有 distinct 值汇总到一处、要么用 HyperLogLog 这类基数估计的概率算法换取近似答案。中位数同理，精确值需要全局排序，工程上常用 t-digest 等近似结构。设计查询时，优先选可分解的聚合形态，是降低跨分片代价的第一原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨分片-join-的三条出路\">跨分片 JOIN 的三条出路</h2><p>JOIN 是跨分片查询里最痛的部分。当要 JOIN 的两张表按不同的键分片时，匹配的行分散在不同机器上，数据库别无选择，只能在网络上搬移数据来完成连接，代价巨大。工程上有三条主流出路。</p>\n<p>第一条是同位置存储（co-location）：让需要频繁 JOIN 的表用同一个分区键，使相关联的行天然落在同一分片，JOIN 就退化为各分片内的本地 JOIN。按 <code>user_id</code> 分片的 <code>users</code> 和 <code>orders</code> 表，做「用户连其订单」就完全本地化——这呼应了 <a href=\"../foundations/partition-keys\">分区键的选择</a> 里强调的查询亲和性。第二条是广播小表（broadcast/reference table）：把不常变的小维度表（如国家、币种、配置）在每个分片各存一份副本，让大表 JOIN 小表时无需跨分片，Citus 的 reference table 就是这一思路。第三条是反规范化（denormalization）：写入时就把要 JOIN 的字段冗余进主表，用空间和写复杂度换查询时免 JOIN。三条路的共同逻辑是「把 JOIN 提前到写入或建模阶段解决，而不是留给查询时」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全局排序与分页的陷阱\">全局排序与分页的陷阱</h2><p>跨分片的 <code>ORDER BY ... LIMIT n</code> 藏着一个直觉上的陷阱：你不能只从每个分片取前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条然后随便拼起来——那样得到的可能不是全局前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。正确做法是每个分片各返回其有序的前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条，协调节点再对这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条做归并排序，取真正的全局前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。这意味着即便最终只要 10 条，集群内部也至少传输了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 条。</p>\n<p>分页（<code>OFFSET m LIMIT n</code>）更糟。要取全局第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m+n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条，朴素实现要求每个分片都返回前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m+n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条供协调节点归并，于是翻得越深、每个分片要吐的数据越多，深分页在跨分片场景下会急剧恶化。务实的解法是改用游标分页（基于上次返回的排序键继续取，<code>WHERE sort_key &gt; last</code>），把「跳过 m 条」换成「从某个值之后取 n 条」，避免深 OFFSET 的扇出爆炸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把跨分片查询降到最少\">把跨分片查询降到最少</h2><p>应对跨分片查询的最高境界，是从一开始就让大多数查询根本不跨分片。这回到了选键的根本：用最高频访问模式决定分区键，让主路径查询单分片命中；对次高频的、不带分区键的查询，用 <a href=\"../operations/global-secondary-indexes\">全局二级索引</a> 把它们重新变回单分片或少分片操作；对确实无法避免的分析型全表聚合，则接受散布-聚集、并尽量用可分解或近似的聚合形态。</p>\n<p>执行层面还要考虑部分失败：散布到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片，只要一个超时或宕机，整个查询的正确性就受影响——是返回部分结果并标注「不完整」，还是整体失败重试？这是路由层必须明确回答的策略问题，详见 <a href=\"../operations/shard-routing\">分片路由与中间件</a>。把跨分片查询当成例外而非常态来设计，是分片系统保持高性能的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨分片查询走散布-聚集模型：散布到相关分片并行执行，再聚集合并，难点在合并与等待。</li>\n<li>聚合分可分解（COUNT/SUM/MAX/AVG 经局部+合并）与不可分解（DISTINCT/中位数需全局视野或近似）。</li>\n<li>跨分片 JOIN 有三条出路：同位置存储、广播小表、反规范化，核心是把 JOIN 提前到建模阶段。</li>\n<li>全局 ORDER BY+LIMIT 需各分片取前 n 再归并；深 OFFSET 分页会扇出爆炸，应改用游标分页。</li>\n<li>最优策略是从选键起就让多数查询单分片命中，跨分片查询当例外处理，并明确部分失败策略。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨分片查询与聚合","id":"跨分片查询与聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可分解聚合与不可分解聚合","id":"可分解聚合与不可分解聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"跨分片 JOIN 的三条出路","id":"跨分片-join-的三条出路"},{"level":2,"text":"全局排序与分页的陷阱","id":"全局排序与分页的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"把跨分片查询降到最少","id":"把跨分片查询降到最少"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"目录分片与一致性哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/strategies/directory-consistent-hashing"},"next":{"title":"热点与数据倾斜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/challenges/hotspots-skew"}}